1
00:00:00,312 --> 00:00:01,392
(Kripke:)How does it work?

2
00:00:01,605 --> 00:00:02,645
(Sheldon:)Oh, it's very simple.

3
00:00:02,856 --> 00:00:05,446
(Sheldon:)Scissors cuts paper,
paper covers rock...

4
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:08,320
(Sheldon:)...rock crushes lizard,
lizard poisons Spock...

5
00:00:08,528 --> 00:00:11,658
(Sheldon:)...Spock smashes scissors,
scissors decapitates lizard...

6
00:00:11,865 --> 00:00:14,535
(Sheldon:)...lizard eats paper,
paper disproves Spock...

7
00:00:14,743 --> 00:00:16,493
(Sheldon:)...Spock vaporizes rock...

8
00:00:16,703 --> 00:00:19,993
(Sheldon:)...and, as it always has,
rock crushes scissors.

9
00:00:24,294 --> 00:00:25,964
I'm sorry, can you repeat that?

10
00:00:27,255 --> 00:00:30,215
(Sheldon:)Well, of course.
Scissors cuts paper, paper covers rock...

11
00:00:30,425 --> 00:00:32,635
(Sheldon:)...rock crushes lizard,
lizard poisons Spock...

12
00:00:32,844 --> 00:00:35,514
(Sheldon:)...Spock smashes scissors,
scissors decapitates lizard...

13
00:00:35,722 --> 00:00:37,852
(Sheldon:)...lizard eats paper,
paper disproves Spock...

14
00:00:38,058 --> 00:00:39,268
(Sheldon:)...Spock vaporizes rock...

15
00:00:39,476 --> 00:00:42,646
(Sheldon:)...and, as it always has,
rock crushes scissors.

16
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:46,610
(Kripke:)Almost got it. One more time.

17
00:00:46,816 --> 00:00:48,656
(Sheldon:)Scissors cuts paper,
paper covers rock...

18
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:51,610
(Howard:)Sheldon, stop.
He's screwing with you.

19
00:00:52,822 --> 00:00:54,322
ls he?

20
00:00:54,533 --> 00:00:57,623
(Sheldon:)Well, then,
seems we have reached an impasse.

21
00:00:57,827 --> 00:01:01,027
l see no other option
than to challenge you to a duel.

